<figure class="vh-demo"><iframe class="vh-demo__frame" title="步骤条（Steps） 演示" src="https://vibe-hub.org/steps" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-forms allow-popups"></iframe><figcaption class="vh-demo__cap">源站预览 · steps · 能力：preview · anatomy · variants · scenarios · judgment-practice · agent-dialogue</figcaption></figure>
